From: hawkff <109485367+hawkff@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 15:03:55 +0000
Subject: Fix build with dfmify_dev_ui disabled

chrome/browser/BUILD.gn depends on //chrome/browser/dev_ui unconditionally
on Android. That target exists only when dfmify_dev_ui is true, and
build/cromite.gn_args sets dfmify_dev_ui to false, so gn gen fails with an
unresolved dependency. Comment out the dependency.

License: GPL-2.0-or-later - https://spdx.org/licenses/GPL-2.0-or-later.html
---
 chrome/browser/BUILD.gn | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/chrome/browser/BUILD.gn b/chrome/browser/BUILD.gn
--- a/chrome/browser/BUILD.gn
+++ b/chrome/browser/BUILD.gn
@@ -1687,7 +1687,7 @@ source_set("core") {
       "//chrome/browser/commerce/android:shopping_service_jni",
       "//chrome/browser/composeplate/android:jni_headers",
       "//chrome/browser/endpoint_fetcher:jni_headers",
-      "//chrome/browser/dev_ui",
+      #"//chrome/browser/dev_ui",
       "//chrome/browser/facilitated_payments",
       "//chrome/browser/feed",
       "//chrome/browser/flags:flags_android",
--
